#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:70
msgid "<a0>STD-SCH-001</a0>: counted by its schedule code and date, wherever it was given (J3: TrustDemoJ3HepB, TrustDemoJ3Bcg)."
msgstr "<a0>STD-SCH-001</a0>: se cuenta por su código de calendario y su fecha, dondequiera que se haya administrado (J3: TrustDemoJ3HepB, TrustDemoJ3Bcg)."

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:11
